+# KEDA templates
+
+This repo includes a KEDA ScaledObject template generator in `api/golden_k8s.py`:
+- `keda_scaledobject_template()`
+
+Rationale:
+- Many installations prefer managing KEDA resources via GitOps (ArgoCD/Flux) rather than API creation.
+
+Recommended:
+1) Apply KEDA operator via Helm.
+2) Use GitOps to apply ScaledObjects per deployment.
+3) Store desired autoscaling config in Aegis `deployments.autoscaling`.
