 # Aegis Golden Path (v1)
 
 Implements the minimal end-to-end platform loop:
@@ -138,6 +138,47 @@ Configure the default eval image:
 Your eval image can:
 - download the model artifact
 - run evaluation
 - write results back to object storage
 - optionally call back into Aegis to set eval_status=pass/fail (future patch)
+
+## Inference upgrades in this patch
+
+### Autoscaling config (HPA/KEDA)
+- Store per-deployment autoscaling in DB:
+  - POST `/v1/deployments/{deployment_id}/autoscale`
+  - Example: `{"type":"hpa","min":1,"max":5,"cpu":70}`
+- HPA creation helper exists in `api/golden_k8s.create_hpa_for_deployment()`
+- KEDA ScaledObject template exists in `api/golden_k8s.keda_scaledobject_template()`
+
+### Proper token metering
+- vLLM: parse OpenAI-style `usage.prompt_tokens`, `usage.completion_tokens`, `usage.total_tokens`
+- Triton: default compute units based on input size (payload characters)
+- Writes input/output tokens into `usage_records`
+
+### Streaming (vLLM SSE passthrough)
+- POST `/v1/infer/stream` (requires proxy enabled and backend=vllm)
+
+## Training upgrades in this patch
+
+### Standard training job contract (PyTorch/HF)
+- POST `/v1/runs/train` launches a K8s Job with a standard set of env vars:
+  - `AEGIS_EVIDENCE_BUCKET`, `AEGIS_EVIDENCE_PREFIX`, `AEGIS_CALLBACK_URL`, etc.
+
+### Run callback endpoint
+- POST `/v1/runs/{run_id}/callback` allows the job (or operator) to post:
+  - metrics JSON
+  - evidence_uri (s3://...)
+  - optional eval_status
+- Updates:
+  - `runs.output`, `runs.evidence_uri`
+  - `model_versions.eval_metrics`, `model_versions.eval_evidence_uri`
+
+### Policy gates extended
+- Deployment now requires:
+  - eval_evidence_uri present (toggle `AEGIS_REQUIRE_EVAL_EVIDENCE=true`)
+  - metrics thresholds pass if configured:
+    - `AEGIS_DEPLOY_METRICS_THRESHOLDS='{"accuracy_min":0.9,"toxicity_max":0.02}'`
